\begin{proof}
For $n\ge 1$, we have
\[
0\le \sqrt{n+1}-\sqrt n
=\frac{(\sqrt{n+1}-\sqrt n)(\sqrt{n+1}+\sqrt n)}{\sqrt{n+1}+\sqrt n}
=\frac{1}{\sqrt{n+1}+\sqrt n}
\le \frac{1}{2\sqrt n}.
\]
Because $1/(2\sqrt n)\to0$, the squeeze theorem yields
\[
\sqrt{n+1}-\sqrt n\to0.
\]
\end{proof}
